{"meta":{"season":2026,"source":"OpenF1 team_radio","note":"per-round per-driver-code clips mapped to lap; url hotlinks F1 livetiming; R1-R4 have no OpenF1 radio","throughRound":11,"total":217},"radio":{"1":{},"2":{},"3":{},"4":{},"5":{"ANT":[{"lap":25,"t":"20:41:53","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-05-24_Canadian_Grand_Prix/2026-05-24_Race/TeamRadio/ANT_12_20260524_164112.mp3","f":"ANT_12_20260524_164112.mp3","cap":"Why, mate? You pushed me off. And I was ahead. Like, what's the point?"},{"lap":41,"t":"21:03:14","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-05-24_Canadian_Grand_Prix/2026-05-24_Race/TeamRadio/ANT_12_20260524_170305.mp3","f":"ANT_12_20260524_170305.mp3","cap":"What is this guy doing, man?"},{"lap":68,"t":"21:39:51","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-05-24_Canadian_Grand_Prix/2026-05-24_Race/TeamRadio/ANT_12_20260524_173905.mp3","f":"ANT_12_20260524_173905.mp3","cap":"Nice work, Kimi. It's been a very eventful day, but well done. Yeah, thank you, everyone. Not the way I wanted to win. It was going to be a good fight with George, but yeah, we'll take it."}],"BOR":[{"lap":1,"t":"19:11:23","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-05-24_Canadian_Grand_Prix/2026-05-24_Race/TeamRadio/BOR_5_20260524_112124.mp3","f":"BOR_5_20260524_112124.mp3","cap":"Yep. What a drive. Good job. Excellent. So good. Set the pressure up. Really good pace. Well done. Thank you."}],"COL":[{"lap":67,"t":"21:43:56","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-05-24_Canadian_Grand_Prix/2026-05-24_Race/TeamRadio/COL_43_20260524_174314.mp3","f":"COL_43_20260524_174314.mp3","cap":"Oh, vamos, buddy. He's six. Good job, mate. Mate. Very good job. Sorry for the extra stress. I don't have much more. Really sorry. I'll check the heart rate. I'll check the heart rate after the race, mate. Mate, fantastic job this weekend. Really, really good driving."},{"lap":67,"t":"21:44:59","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-05-24_Canadian_Grand_Prix/2026-05-24_Race/TeamRadio/COL_43_20260524_174426.mp3","f":"COL_43_20260524_174426.mp3","cap":"I've got the boss on my shoulder here, he's a very happy man, so that is P6, that's your best ever result in F1 now mate, another week, another best."}],"GAS":[{"lap":1,"t":"20:03:12","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-05-24_Canadian_Grand_Prix/2026-05-24_Race/TeamRadio/GAS_10_20260524_160246.mp3","f":"GAS_10_20260524_160246.mp3","cap":"The drivers aren't into tyres or complaining already, so you're on the right one here."}],"HAD":[{"lap":1,"t":"19:11:23","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-05-24_Canadian_Grand_Prix/2026-05-24_Race/TeamRadio/HAD_6_20260524_121726.mp3","f":"HAD_6_20260524_121726.mp3","cap":"You think it's worth it already to go to the shop? How do you feel the tyres? They are still alive, so maybe wait a little bit. And for the moment they're okay. The only thing can be rear overheating a little bit."}],"HAM":[{"lap":9,"t":"20:21:31","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-05-24_Canadian_Grand_Prix/2026-05-24_Race/TeamRadio/HAM_44_20260524_162056.mp3","f":"HAM_44_20260524_162056.mp3","cap":"I got no power, man. Come on, guys."},{"lap":44,"t":"21:06:48","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-05-24_Canadian_Grand_Prix/2026-05-24_Race/TeamRadio/HAM_44_20260524_170614.mp3","f":"HAM_44_20260524_170614.mp3","cap":"You have same pace as Antonelli, P1 to 10 faster than Max in front."},{"lap":49,"t":"21:13:25","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-05-24_Canadian_Grand_Prix/2026-05-24_Race/TeamRadio/HAM_44_20260524_171312.mp3","f":"HAM_44_20260524_171312.mp3","cap":"We can do this, guys. Push it."},{"lap":58,"t":"21:25:37","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-05-24_Canadian_Grand_Prix/2026-05-24_Race/TeamRadio/HAM_44_20260524_172525.mp3","f":"HAM_44_20260524_172525.mp3","cap":"They both are amazing."},{"lap":68,"t":"21:40:23","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-05-24_Canadian_Grand_Prix/2026-05-24_Race/TeamRadio/HAM_44_20260524_173930.mp3","f":"HAM_44_20260524_173930.mp3","cap":"And we're done. Pichu, that was a great fight. Good job, good job. That was tough, guys. Make a job this weekend. Definitely the result we deserve. Thank you so much to everyone back at the factory. Grazie a tutti. Let's keep pushing. This is a good step. Let's keep working to try and close that gap. Thank you, Luis."}],"LAW":[{"lap":67,"t":"21:44:29","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-05-24_Canadian_Grand_Prix/2026-05-24_Race/TeamRadio/LAW_30_20260524_174356.mp3","f":"LAW_30_20260524_174356.mp3","cap":"Well done guys. I really struggled to put pace in that race. I think we messed up there at the start, especially, but it's even on the last set. Yeah, probably out of balance a bit and we will show you some things when you come back. Copy that. Otherwise, really good job."}],"LEC":[{"lap":1,"t":"19:11:53","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-05-24_Canadian_Grand_Prix/2026-05-24_Race/TeamRadio/LEC_16_20260524_130022.mp3","f":"LEC_16_20260524_130022.mp3","cap":"Can you at least tell me what the plan is, like what are we trying to do? We're trying to wait for rain, mate, so to keep the track position and so if it rains everyone has to stop so we keep that position, you know?"},{"lap":35,"t":"20:55:36","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-05-24_Canadian_Grand_Prix/2026-05-24_Race/TeamRadio/LEC_16_20260524_165510.mp3","f":"LEC_16_20260524_165510.mp3","cap":"Okay, that was really a cheap one."},{"lap":50,"t":"21:14:59","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-05-24_Canadian_Grand_Prix/2026-05-24_Race/TeamRadio/LEC_16_20260524_171412.mp3","f":"LEC_16_20260524_171412.mp3","cap":"Blue is now picking up the pace, 15.0. Let's top the ticket until the last lap, until the last lap. And anything absolutely critical."}],"LIN":[{"lap":1,"t":"20:03:42","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-05-24_Canadian_Grand_Prix/2026-05-24_Race/TeamRadio/LIN_41_20260524_160334.mp3","f":"LIN_41_20260524_160334.mp3","cap":"It's not going again."}],"NOR":[{"lap":1,"t":"19:11:21","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-05-24_Canadian_Grand_Prix/2026-05-24_Race/TeamRadio/NOR_1_20260524_124627.mp3","f":"NOR_1_20260524_124627.mp3","cap":"That's all the way, mate. That's all the way. You now need to keep it cool. Reset."},{"lap":1,"t":"19:11:23","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-05-24_Canadian_Grand_Prix/2026-05-24_Race/TeamRadio/NOR_1_20260524_124935.mp3","f":"NOR_1_20260524_124935.mp3","cap":"There's no reason to go back anymore. I have a very big reason. If you get a penalty for Monaco, I'm going to win. So I want you to be back on track, even if you are two or three laps down, I don't care. I want the penalty today."},{"lap":1,"t":"20:03:12","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-05-24_Canadian_Grand_Prix/2026-05-24_Race/TeamRadio/NOR_1_20260524_160301.mp3","f":"NOR_1_20260524_160301.mp3","cap":"Any comments on conditions, Lando? Yeah, I don't know. We'll see."},{"lap":4,"t":"20:14:54","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-05-24_Canadian_Grand_Prix/2026-05-24_Race/TeamRadio/NOR_1_20260524_161435.mp3","f":"NOR_1_20260524_161435.mp3","cap":"Although we could be going very long here."},{"lap":15,"t":"20:30:11","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-05-24_Canadian_Grand_Prix/2026-05-24_Race/TeamRadio/NOR_1_20260524_162952.mp3","f":"NOR_1_20260524_162952.mp3","cap":"We need to box this lap. It's a reliability problem."},{"lap":39,"t":"21:02:12","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-05-24_Canadian_Grand_Prix/2026-05-24_Race/TeamRadio/NOR_1_20260524_170139.mp3","f":"NOR_1_20260524_170139.mp3","cap":"Something's broken about a gearbox or something."},{"lap":39,"t":"21:02:43","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-05-24_Canadian_Grand_Prix/2026-05-24_Race/TeamRadio/NOR_1_20260524_170226.mp3","f":"NOR_1_20260524_170226.mp3","cap":"Sorry about that. All right. Thank you. All good."}],"PER":[{"lap":40,"t":"21:06:48","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-05-24_Canadian_Grand_Prix/2026-05-24_Race/TeamRadio/PER_11_20260524_170619.mp3","f":"PER_11_20260524_170619.mp3","cap":"I'm listening to you, Strollenberger. Yeah, I'm listening to you. Thank you, I'll tell you more about that in a second."}],"PIA":[{"lap":1,"t":"19:27:39","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-05-24_Canadian_Grand_Prix/2026-05-24_Race/TeamRadio/PIA_81_20260524_152723.mp3","f":"PIA_81_20260524_152723.mp3","cap":"Are you happy on these tyres or do you want to enter? Honestly, I have no idea. It's really tough, honestly. But I'm surprised the inter is working."},{"lap":1,"t":"20:05:14","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-05-24_Canadian_Grand_Prix/2026-05-24_Race/TeamRadio/PIA_81_20260524_160438.mp3","f":"PIA_81_20260524_160438.mp3","cap":"It feels like the rain stopped quite a lot now. What are we thinking to do? Oscar, Hawker, the rain should ease from here. Everyone's going to have very cold tyres. Yeah, but I think now, I think it is time for slicks. Should we just box?"},{"lap":1,"t":"20:08:48","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-05-24_Canadian_Grand_Prix/2026-05-24_Race/TeamRadio/PIA_81_20260524_160758.mp3","f":"PIA_81_20260524_160758.mp3","cap":"So, Oscar, our tyres have dropped quite a lot. Everyone on stock must have very cold tyres by this time. Yeah, but if we fit now, we will have cold tyres. We will have warm tyres. So, I don't know, it's, I mean, it's, these engines are a mistake now."}],"RUS":[{"lap":1,"t":"19:11:23","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-05-24_Canadian_Grand_Prix/2026-05-24_Race/TeamRadio/RUS_63_20260523_160721.mp3","f":"RUS_63_20260523_160721.mp3","cap":"I don't know why the ride has felt quite a bit worse today than yesterday."},{"lap":26,"t":"20:42:53","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-05-24_Canadian_Grand_Prix/2026-05-24_Race/TeamRadio/RUS_63_20260524_164224.mp3","f":"RUS_63_20260524_164224.mp3","cap":"Hemi will give you the position. Convenient, just before the freeze. I think that was just when it was given to him. So head down, Stroll, Bortoleto, go."}],"VER":[{"lap":1,"t":"19:22:05","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-05-24_Canadian_Grand_Prix/2026-05-24_Race/TeamRadio/VER_3_20260524_152145.mp3","f":"VER_3_20260524_152145.mp3","cap":"I think this is switch. Copy that Max. Box, switch to select skipper."},{"lap":68,"t":"21:40:53","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-05-24_Canadian_Grand_Prix/2026-05-24_Race/TeamRadio/VER_3_20260524_174019.mp3","f":"VER_3_20260524_174019.mp3","cap":"Good job Max, we didn't fight out there today, hold on. Yeah, it's just a shame we didn't have the tyre attack for the final scene. Really difficult, but good job. That's the first road in."}]},"6":{"ALB":[{"lap":45,"t":"14:03:09","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-07_Monaco_Grand_Prix/2026-06-07_Race/TeamRadio/ALB_23_20260607_160244.mp3","f":"ALB_23_20260607_160244.mp3","cap":"Is there a reason for this? Because if I'm Peter, what should I do? I mean, I'm happy to do it, but I just, are we just risking something for nothing, or?"},{"lap":78,"t":"15:35:57","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-07_Monaco_Grand_Prix/2026-06-07_Race/TeamRadio/ALB_23_20260607_173615.mp3","f":"ALB_23_20260607_173615.mp3","cap":"Alex, it was a tough afternoon to walk away with. P8 is a good result. Well done to you. I know it's tough out there with all the battery issues and the car. We'll look into that, but well done. P8, really good points. We'll keep moving forward. Yeah, thanks, James. Yeah, it'll be interesting to know how much of it pays solo, isn't it? Straight back speed. Yeah, well done. It's been a weekend, so thanks, everyone. Thanks for the hard work."}],"ANT":[{"lap":51,"t":"14:08:15","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-07_Monaco_Grand_Prix/2026-06-07_Race/TeamRadio/ANT_12_20260607_160731.mp3","f":"ANT_12_20260607_160731.mp3","cap":"And if we were to stop again under safety car, we have plenty of margin. You just have to be really careful on the entry and exit. What you did last time was perfectly fine. Yeah, but I don't think we need to stop. No, no, no. It's only safety car. You can get a free stop, that's all."},{"lap":57,"t":"14:15:21","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-07_Monaco_Grand_Prix/2026-06-07_Race/TeamRadio/ANT_12_20260607_161447.mp3","f":"ANT_12_20260607_161447.mp3","cap":"There's something weird with the engine off the hill. Let's have a look."},{"lap":57,"t":"14:16:21","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-07_Monaco_Grand_Prix/2026-06-07_Race/TeamRadio/ANT_12_20260607_161605.mp3","f":"ANT_12_20260607_161605.mp3","cap":"OK, give me fastest lap, we don't beat them."},{"lap":62,"t":"14:23:58","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-07_Monaco_Grand_Prix/2026-06-07_Race/TeamRadio/ANT_12_20260607_162334.mp3","f":"ANT_12_20260607_162334.mp3","cap":"What do I do? I was too late. They're gonna play it, man."}],"BEA":[{"lap":28,"t":"13:42:50","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-07_Monaco_Grand_Prix/2026-06-07_Race/TeamRadio/BEA_87_20260607_154229.mp3","f":"BEA_87_20260607_154229.mp3","cap":"Sorry guys, on our weekend. Yeah, sorry Oli. We'll go again next week."}],"HAD":[{"lap":16,"t":"13:23:02","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-07_Monaco_Grand_Prix/2026-06-07_Race/TeamRadio/HAD_6_20260607_152233.mp3","f":"HAD_6_20260607_152233.mp3","cap":"I don't know. I don't know."},{"lap":20,"t":"13:29:08","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-07_Monaco_Grand_Prix/2026-06-07_Race/TeamRadio/HAD_6_20260607_152831.mp3","f":"HAD_6_20260607_152831.mp3","cap":"Board 6, board 6, we're looking to it mate, we're looking to it. Also the power is gone. The power."},{"lap":27,"t":"13:37:44","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-07_Monaco_Grand_Prix/2026-06-07_Race/TeamRadio/HAD_6_20260607_153707.mp3","f":"HAD_6_20260607_153707.mp3","cap":"Yeah, no power, out of fate, out of fate. Yeah, copy that mate, we can see the issue, we're trying to work on a fix. You're doing a great job. Engine 3, position 11. Engine 3, position 11."},{"lap":35,"t":"13:48:24","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-07_Monaco_Grand_Prix/2026-06-07_Race/TeamRadio/HAD_6_20260607_154751.mp3","f":"HAD_6_20260607_154751.mp3","cap":"Hey, the problem is still real. Yeah, we're still looking for another fix. We are looking for another fix."},{"lap":70,"t":"15:14:12","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-07_Monaco_Grand_Prix/2026-06-07_Race/TeamRadio/HAD_6_20260607_171340.mp3","f":"HAD_6_20260607_171340.mp3","cap":"Yeah, keep pushing, keep pushing, aeronautical power, it's coming back."}],"HAM":[{"lap":1,"t":"12:25:08","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-07_Monaco_Grand_Prix/2026-06-07_Race/TeamRadio/HAM_44_20260607_142445.mp3","f":"HAM_44_20260607_142445.mp3","cap":""},{"lap":9,"t":"13:13:52","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-07_Monaco_Grand_Prix/2026-06-07_Race/TeamRadio/HAM_44_20260607_151337.mp3","f":"HAM_44_20260607_151337.mp3","cap":"Where is the faster? It's faster entry 3 and entry 4."},{"lap":75,"t":"15:22:20","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-07_Monaco_Grand_Prix/2026-06-07_Race/TeamRadio/HAM_44_20260607_172206.mp3","f":"HAM_44_20260607_172206.mp3","cap":"And delay turn in 5 and 6. Thank you so much."},{"lap":78,"t":"15:28:56","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-07_Monaco_Grand_Prix/2026-06-07_Race/TeamRadio/HAM_44_20260607_172801.mp3","f":"HAM_44_20260607_172801.mp3","cap":"And well done, Lewis. Great job, guys. Sorry I couldn't pull the wind. Sorry I couldn't get the wind in the end. They just had their upper hand on us this weekend. But mega result. Really grateful for all the hard work and let's continue to push. Thank you. Grazie a tutti. Grazie a tutti, Lewis. For today, we can be happy."}],"LAW":[{"lap":1,"t":"12:28:43","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-07_Monaco_Grand_Prix/2026-06-07_Race/TeamRadio/LAW_30_20260607_142803.mp3","f":"LAW_30_20260607_142803.mp3","cap":"Well done, everybody. You're doing a good job. You've done your best. Today doesn't make it worth it. Thank you, Liam."}],"LEC":[{"lap":65,"t":"14:32:36","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-07_Monaco_Grand_Prix/2026-06-07_Race/TeamRadio/LEC_16_20260607_163159.mp3","f":"LEC_16_20260607_163159.mp3","cap":"I'm not, I'm not, I'm not, I'm not going to take the f***ing lane. Please f***ing brake!"}],"LIN":[{"lap":78,"t":"15:33:31","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-07_Monaco_Grand_Prix/2026-06-07_Race/TeamRadio/LIN_41_20260607_173220.mp3","f":"LIN_41_20260607_173220.mp3","cap":"Pistons, Arvids, Wendel, VFB 5, York Pistons. What are they? Well, congratulations everyone. Unbelievable result. Amazing work. Yeah, thank you to everyone. Thank you to everyone on the track and fans and full team kids as well. Amazing result from the team. Congratulations. Arvids, Arvids, well done mate. Thank you for your patience. Thank you for your team play and I paid off brilliant pretty stuff. Yeah, congratulations guys. Thanks Alan. What's the real team effort today? We have a goal some block but amazing execution for everyone"}],"NOR":[{"lap":6,"t":"13:10:20","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-07_Monaco_Grand_Prix/2026-06-07_Race/TeamRadio/NOR_1_20260607_150948.mp3","f":"NOR_1_20260607_150948.mp3","cap":"Butchers, outsiders, grid box."},{"lap":42,"t":"13:57:33","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-07_Monaco_Grand_Prix/2026-06-07_Race/TeamRadio/NOR_1_20260607_155721.mp3","f":"NOR_1_20260607_155721.mp3","cap":"We want to do the holding strategy on Russell. We want to build up the seconds over the next couple of laps."},{"lap":44,"t":"14:01:36","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-07_Monaco_Grand_Prix/2026-06-07_Race/TeamRadio/NOR_1_20260607_160057.mp3","f":"NOR_1_20260607_160057.mp3","cap":"Lado, just, we're going to box this lap and retire the car. We're going to box the lap and retire the car."},{"lap":44,"t":"14:04:09","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-07_Monaco_Grand_Prix/2026-06-07_Race/TeamRadio/NOR_1_20260607_160401.mp3","f":"NOR_1_20260607_160401.mp3","cap":"Something's wrong. I got nothing. My battery."}],"OCO":[{"lap":78,"t":"15:35:57","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-07_Monaco_Grand_Prix/2026-06-07_Race/TeamRadio/OCO_31_20260607_173835.mp3","f":"OCO_31_20260607_173835.mp3","cap":"Nice job. We definitely deserve this one. Yeah, good job, guys. Good job. Hats off to the strategists today. That was quite impressive. Thank you. Shout out to Hazard and Edge. Yes. Okay, S1. We're P9, actually, because Nico got a 10-second penalty. Copy that. Awesome. Awesome. Was Hadjar third? Yes. Yes, he is, actually. Yeah, super happy for you. That's nice. I'm very happy for us too. So P1, wait a few seconds and go to P0. Thank you for this weekend guys. Thank you man."}],"PIA":[{"lap":68,"t":"15:10:39","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-07_Monaco_Grand_Prix/2026-06-07_Race/TeamRadio/PIA_81_20260607_171009.mp3","f":"PIA_81_20260607_171009.mp3","cap":"Undercut, the FAA have said unlikely discrepancy for the standing restock, a piece of laps behind the safety car. They've said they'll take a very dim view if people leave more than 10 car lengths."},{"lap":78,"t":"15:35:35","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-07_Monaco_Grand_Prix/2026-06-07_Race/TeamRadio/PIA_81_20260607_173431.mp3","f":"PIA_81_20260607_173431.mp3","cap":"Good afternoon mate, that was good, good progress from an E7 start. Yep, yeah, well done. Uh, yeah. Definitely didn't make up those three spots on pace, but uh, we stuck in at 1.2, and well done. Yeah, I heard what you said, we will be obviously doing everything we can to pay attention. Just to say again, good job mate. I know we did lack pace, but uh, we kept it clean, we stayed out of trouble most of the day. and it's a good result for the way we're about to speak."}],"RUS":[{"lap":16,"t":"13:24:02","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-07_Monaco_Grand_Prix/2026-06-07_Race/TeamRadio/RUS_63_20260607_152339.mp3","f":"RUS_63_20260607_152339.mp3","cap":"Hadjar had front left brain and he won't be out for much longer I don't think. Just make sure you've got good tyres when he does get out of the way."},{"lap":18,"t":"13:26:34","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-07_Monaco_Grand_Prix/2026-06-07_Race/TeamRadio/RUS_63_20260607_152610.mp3","f":"RUS_63_20260607_152610.mp3","cap":"George, how much pace would you have in clear air? At least one second, I think."},{"lap":28,"t":"13:38:45","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-07_Monaco_Grand_Prix/2026-06-07_Race/TeamRadio/RUS_63_20260607_153832.mp3","f":"RUS_63_20260607_153832.mp3","cap":"That's a last ten advantage, they can't keep it on the truck, they need to get the position up, copy, they're just outbraking themselves, they don't want no tyres."},{"lap":65,"t":"14:29:33","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-07_Monaco_Grand_Prix/2026-06-07_Race/TeamRadio/RUS_63_20260607_162906.mp3","f":"RUS_63_20260607_162906.mp3","cap":"And have I served my penalty or not? I spent about 10 seconds in the pit lane, locked within the Hadjar. Watch, let's talk about it after. Yeah, I just need to know if I'm in a 5 second penalty and I'm stood behind Hadjar on hard tyres. George, George, I'll give you the messages as the messages come through, okay? Yeah, alright, thanks."},{"lap":68,"t":"14:57:58","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-07_Monaco_Grand_Prix/2026-06-07_Race/TeamRadio/RUS_63_20260607_165733.mp3","f":"RUS_63_20260607_165733.mp3","cap":"Hadjar, tank car left. Wait a moment, tank car left. Copy."}],"SAI":[{"lap":29,"t":"13:41:18","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-07_Monaco_Grand_Prix/2026-06-07_Race/TeamRadio/SAI_55_20260607_154059.mp3","f":"SAI_55_20260607_154059.mp3","cap":"What do you think about plant B? Eh, repeat what was plant B, now I forgot it. Take I, yeah, take I out of the stop."},{"lap":30,"t":"13:41:50","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-07_Monaco_Grand_Prix/2026-06-07_Race/TeamRadio/SAI_55_20260607_154129.mp3","f":"SAI_55_20260607_154129.mp3","cap":"It's up to you. You're up for it. Follow me."},{"lap":48,"t":"14:06:11","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-07_Monaco_Grand_Prix/2026-06-07_Race/TeamRadio/SAI_55_20260607_160551.mp3","f":"SAI_55_20260607_160551.mp3","cap":"You're at the point now, don't be stuck."}],"VER":[{"lap":1,"t":"13:04:44","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-07_Monaco_Grand_Prix/2026-06-07_Race/TeamRadio/VER_3_20260607_150430.mp3","f":"VER_3_20260607_150430.mp3","cap":"What's it like here? Just bring it home for these guys."},{"lap":1,"t":"13:09:50","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-07_Monaco_Grand_Prix/2026-06-07_Race/TeamRadio/VER_3_20260607_150926.mp3","f":"VER_3_20260607_150926.mp3","cap":"Oh, nice."}]},"7":{"ANT":[{"lap":1,"t":"12:29:37","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-14_Barcelona_Grand_Prix/2026-06-14_Race/TeamRadio/ANT_12_20260614_142921.mp3","f":"ANT_12_20260614_142921.mp3","cap":"Brakes feel quite bad already, quite long. Feels like air is in the system. Copy, we'll have a look at it."},{"lap":22,"t":"13:33:03","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-14_Barcelona_Grand_Prix/2026-06-14_Race/TeamRadio/ANT_12_20260614_153235.mp3","f":"ANT_12_20260614_153235.mp3","cap":"Happy with fortune? Affirm, Kimi. Good lap times."},{"lap":30,"t":"13:44:11","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-14_Barcelona_Grand_Prix/2026-06-14_Race/TeamRadio/ANT_12_20260614_154351.mp3","f":"ANT_12_20260614_154351.mp3","cap":"It's going to give me black or white flag for track limits, so no more of those please, otherwise it's a 5 second penalty."},{"lap":34,"t":"13:49:46","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-14_Barcelona_Grand_Prix/2026-06-14_Race/TeamRadio/ANT_12_20260614_154909.mp3","f":"ANT_12_20260614_154909.mp3","cap":"Give you a reminder, the track limits, let's not take any risks."},{"lap":35,"t":"13:51:17","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-14_Barcelona_Grand_Prix/2026-06-14_Race/TeamRadio/ANT_12_20260614_155042.mp3","f":"ANT_12_20260614_155042.mp3","cap":"Thank you, it won't be long for George. We are at risk for Norris behind in 3.9 seconds."},{"lap":35,"t":"13:51:48","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-14_Barcelona_Grand_Prix/2026-06-14_Race/TeamRadio/ANT_12_20260614_155119.mp3","f":"ANT_12_20260614_155119.mp3","cap":"So let's not slow each other down racing, we need to keep that gap to Norris, nice and healthy, now at 4.3."},{"lap":37,"t":"13:54:22","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-14_Barcelona_Grand_Prix/2026-06-14_Race/TeamRadio/ANT_12_20260614_155413.mp3","f":"ANT_12_20260614_155413.mp3","cap":"It won't be long, Kimi. Got to cover Norris."},{"lap":53,"t":"14:16:10","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-14_Barcelona_Grand_Prix/2026-06-14_Race/TeamRadio/ANT_12_20260614_161533.mp3","f":"ANT_12_20260614_161533.mp3","cap":"Gap at 0.9, 1.3 behind. Copy that, Gibby."},{"lap":62,"t":"14:29:22","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-14_Barcelona_Grand_Prix/2026-06-14_Race/TeamRadio/ANT_12_20260614_162900.mp3","f":"ANT_12_20260614_162900.mp3","cap":"5 laps remaining, so just warning for track limits everywhere, turn 5 exit, turn 10 exit."}],"COL":[{"lap":20,"t":"13:31:29","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-14_Barcelona_Grand_Prix/2026-06-14_Race/TeamRadio/COL_43_20260614_153044.mp3","f":"COL_43_20260614_153044.mp3","cap":"Okay, Frank, this is an instruction, we need to switch cars into turn 1, please switch into turn 1. Switch cars? Paper, 2 into turn 4, please turn 4, switch the cars. It's 1, I can stick on the spot. I feel bitchy."},{"lap":65,"t":"14:40:24","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-14_Barcelona_Grand_Prix/2026-06-14_Race/TeamRadio/COL_43_20260614_164437.mp3","f":"COL_43_20260614_164437.mp3","cap":"Well done, Robert Burns. You're the ultimate."}],"HAD":[{"lap":65,"t":"14:40:24","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-14_Barcelona_Grand_Prix/2026-06-14_Race/TeamRadio/HAD_6_20260614_164656.mp3","f":"HAD_6_20260614_164656.mp3","cap":"I'm going to apologise for that start to the tournament night. Yeah, I mean, the whole weekend has been terrible, so... Like, there's one task for us. And to break the ring is just the start, please. Because we're going backwards now."}],"HAM":[{"lap":1,"t":"12:24:31","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-14_Barcelona_Grand_Prix/2026-06-14_Race/TeamRadio/HAM_44_20260614_142413.mp3","f":"HAM_44_20260614_142413.mp3","cap":"Eval, what do you think of it? What do you think of what it says? Maybe looking for ears?"},{"lap":32,"t":"13:47:45","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-14_Barcelona_Grand_Prix/2026-06-14_Race/TeamRadio/HAM_44_20260614_154710.mp3","f":"HAM_44_20260614_154710.mp3","cap":"Do you know what time we need to do? 20.9, Charlie's in 4th, you are a different strategy."},{"lap":34,"t":"13:50:47","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-14_Barcelona_Grand_Prix/2026-06-14_Race/TeamRadio/HAM_44_20260614_155019.mp3","f":"HAM_44_20260614_155019.mp3","cap":"Am I catching now? You are catching really well. Keep pushing, keep pushing."},{"lap":39,"t":"13:57:23","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-14_Barcelona_Grand_Prix/2026-06-14_Race/TeamRadio/HAM_44_20260614_155654.mp3","f":"HAM_44_20260614_155654.mp3","cap":"And we are planning other seven laps on this set. This is our race. Give everything these seven laps. It's the critical moment. We have our chance."},{"lap":42,"t":"14:01:58","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-14_Barcelona_Grand_Prix/2026-06-14_Race/TeamRadio/HAM_44_20260614_160131.mp3","f":"HAM_44_20260614_160131.mp3","cap":"And you are informed."},{"lap":42,"t":"14:02:28","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-14_Barcelona_Grand_Prix/2026-06-14_Race/TeamRadio/HAM_44_20260614_160155.mp3","f":"HAM_44_20260614_160155.mp3","cap":"Great job guys!"},{"lap":52,"t":"14:15:10","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-14_Barcelona_Grand_Prix/2026-06-14_Race/TeamRadio/HAM_44_20260614_161436.mp3","f":"HAM_44_20260614_161436.mp3","cap":"15 laps to go, you are doing a good job, so you can go on."},{"lap":59,"t":"14:24:48","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-14_Barcelona_Grand_Prix/2026-06-14_Race/TeamRadio/HAM_44_20260614_162432.mp3","f":"HAM_44_20260614_162432.mp3","cap":"And V-MIG-3, suggestion? I don't know where I am. I think I put... Russell to EPIC-1."},{"lap":66,"t":"14:38:01","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-14_Barcelona_Grand_Prix/2026-06-14_Race/TeamRadio/HAM_44_20260614_163708.mp3","f":"HAM_44_20260614_163708.mp3","cap":"Well done Luis, well done. Finally, you both, you deserve the first ERA that we will always remember. Thank you. Congratulations with G. Grazie a tutti. I'm Marinello. Thank you so much. You helped me achieve this dream and I just, I can't thank you enough. thank you for everyone pushing so hard back at home I'm so proud of you and to my family I love you and to the fans thank you for continue to remind me who I am it's done this without you can I see it got the bad boys"},{"lap":66,"t":"14:39:02","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-14_Barcelona_Grand_Prix/2026-06-14_Race/TeamRadio/HAM_44_20260614_163825.mp3","f":"HAM_44_20260614_163825.mp3","cap":"Let's go! For the Ferrari! For the Ferrari! Guys, thank you for those great pit stops as well. Sorry I have to talk and I'm so proud of you. Thank you."}],"HUL":[{"lap":24,"t":"13:37:35","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-14_Barcelona_Grand_Prix/2026-06-14_Race/TeamRadio/HUL_27_20260614_153713.mp3","f":"HUL_27_20260614_153713.mp3","cap":"Brakes on the brakes. Dangerous."}],"LEC":[{"lap":16,"t":"13:24:53","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-14_Barcelona_Grand_Prix/2026-06-14_Race/TeamRadio/LEC_16_20260614_152415.mp3","f":"LEC_16_20260614_152415.mp3","cap":"And box Charles, box, we have the gap to cover Piastri. We don't care about Piastri, let's look for the head before the face. Okay, let me know on flat, we stay out this lap then, stay out this lap."},{"lap":62,"t":"14:29:53","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-14_Barcelona_Grand_Prix/2026-06-14_Race/TeamRadio/LEC_16_20260614_162944.mp3","f":"LEC_16_20260614_162944.mp3","cap":"Ah, look the faster. Ah, I'm losing the faster."}],"LIN":[{"lap":65,"t":"14:40:24","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-14_Barcelona_Grand_Prix/2026-06-14_Race/TeamRadio/LIN_41_20260614_164234.mp3","f":"LIN_41_20260614_164234.mp3","cap":"But your pace was tough, so that's a lot of things there for you. Yeah, let's thank you for the work, let's review when we get back next week, see if we could have done better, but we lost the time. But regardless, thank you for the effort, and I think it was an okay day."}],"NOR":[{"lap":9,"t":"13:15:45","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-14_Barcelona_Grand_Prix/2026-06-14_Race/TeamRadio/NOR_1_20260614_151530.mp3","f":"NOR_1_20260614_151530.mp3","cap":"How's the pace, how's the tyres? Just, yeah, sliding everywhere."},{"lap":49,"t":"14:12:06","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-14_Barcelona_Grand_Prix/2026-06-14_Race/TeamRadio/NOR_1_20260614_161143.mp3","f":"NOR_1_20260614_161143.mp3","cap":"And Land of Our Race is having better pace over the whole stint than the cars ahead. I just said pace, so I either go with them or I drop back and it's gone. So I can't devise, I'm afraid."},{"lap":51,"t":"14:13:40","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-14_Barcelona_Grand_Prix/2026-06-14_Race/TeamRadio/NOR_1_20260614_161310.mp3","f":"NOR_1_20260614_161310.mp3","cap":"Zalando, at the end of the race, I want to be with him, but give me a head, he's got three strikes already."},{"lap":53,"t":"14:17:12","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-14_Barcelona_Grand_Prix/2026-06-14_Race/TeamRadio/NOR_1_20260614_161650.mp3","f":"NOR_1_20260614_161650.mp3","cap":"And it's quite clear that Antonelli's been off track more than three times. We've reported it to the FIA. We expect he should get at least a five second penalty."},{"lap":66,"t":"14:40:24","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-14_Barcelona_Grand_Prix/2026-06-14_Race/TeamRadio/NOR_1_20260614_164037.mp3","f":"NOR_1_20260614_164037.mp3","cap":"Ah, that's P3, P3, bottom eight. Yeah, well done, race. See us back on the third, guys. Please just keep it going. We need to catch them up, we need to catch them up."}],"RUS":[{"lap":12,"t":"13:19:48","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-14_Barcelona_Grand_Prix/2026-06-14_Race/TeamRadio/RUS_63_20260614_151935.mp3","f":"RUS_63_20260614_151935.mp3","cap":"Is that Lewis in? He's probably going for a three."},{"lap":15,"t":"13:23:21","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-14_Barcelona_Grand_Prix/2026-06-14_Race/TeamRadio/RUS_63_20260614_152240.mp3","f":"RUS_63_20260614_152240.mp3","cap":"If I was managing in that first stint, you could have given me the heads up, but you've exposed me to Kimi now. I don't think it's going to be long for everyone. If I need it up there, you haven't planned that for me, Victor, I really think. Still on plan here, Jordan. Nothing to worry about, yeah."},{"lap":29,"t":"13:43:40","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-14_Barcelona_Grand_Prix/2026-06-14_Race/TeamRadio/RUS_63_20260614_154302.mp3","f":"RUS_63_20260614_154302.mp3","cap":"To update, Lewis will be on a 3. We are still racing at Norris so we need to keep these lap times going."},{"lap":40,"t":"13:58:55","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-14_Barcelona_Grand_Prix/2026-06-14_Race/TeamRadio/RUS_63_20260614_155835.mp3","f":"RUS_63_20260614_155835.mp3","cap":"And we are forecast to be battling with Lewis end of race on that three stop."},{"lap":44,"t":"14:04:00","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-14_Barcelona_Grand_Prix/2026-06-14_Race/TeamRadio/RUS_63_20260614_160340.mp3","f":"RUS_63_20260614_160340.mp3","cap":"24 laps remaining. That's the race up ahead of you. Got 1.3 behind."},{"lap":53,"t":"14:16:11","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-14_Barcelona_Grand_Prix/2026-06-14_Race/TeamRadio/RUS_63_20260614_161559.mp3","f":"RUS_63_20260614_161559.mp3","cap":"I want to pick up the pace here, George."},{"lap":66,"t":"14:40:24","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-14_Barcelona_Grand_Prix/2026-06-14_Race/TeamRadio/RUS_63_20260614_164059.mp3","f":"RUS_63_20260614_164059.mp3","cap":"Okay, set, 8-2. Tough race, sorry if you can't hear me. Yeah, I agree, tough race for the team."}],"VER":[{"lap":11,"t":"13:18:47","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-14_Barcelona_Grand_Prix/2026-06-14_Race/TeamRadio/VER_3_20260614_151828.mp3","f":"VER_3_20260614_151828.mp3","cap":"It's not like I'm up to the tyres. I'm meeting the public on the street. It's quite impressive. Copy."},{"lap":66,"t":"14:40:24","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-14_Barcelona_Grand_Prix/2026-06-14_Race/TeamRadio/VER_3_20260614_164252.mp3","f":"VER_3_20260614_164252.mp3","cap":"Well done, Max. Yep. Yeah, I think so. I mean, yeah, it's one race. The other one's ahead. But, yeah, it's all right. Well done, Max. That was the maximum. I like the way we had shift today. Well done. It's a place and a high amount all through the race. Well done. Thanks, guys. Thanks, guys. Thanks, guys. Thanks, guys. Thanks. Thanks, guys. Thanks, guys. Thanks, guys. Thanks, guys. Thanks, guys. Thanks, guys. Thanks, guys. Thanks, guys. Thanks, guys. Thanks, guys. Thanks, guys. Thanks, guys."}]},"8":{"ANT":[{"lap":27,"t":"13:36:04","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-28_Austrian_Grand_Prix/2026-06-28_Race/TeamRadio/ANT_12_20260628_153534.mp3","f":"ANT_12_20260628_153534.mp3","cap":"Bono, what is happening within brake? I have no confidence. Got a brake split, mate, so one's hotter than the other."},{"lap":50,"t":"14:04:30","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-28_Austrian_Grand_Prix/2026-06-28_Race/TeamRadio/ANT_12_20260628_160408.mp3","f":"ANT_12_20260628_160408.mp3","cap":"Okay, come here, let's go. Just maintain the focus."}],"GAS":[{"lap":1,"t":"12:32:10","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-28_Austrian_Grand_Prix/2026-06-28_Race/TeamRadio/GAS_10_20260628_143137.mp3","f":"GAS_10_20260628_143137.mp3","cap":"And the water is like 45 degrees. Yeah, lucky."}],"HAM":[{"lap":13,"t":"13:18:48","url":"https://livetiming.formula1.com/static/2026/2026-06-28_Austrian_Grand_Prix/2026-06-28_Race/TeamRadio/HAM_44_20260628_151833.mp3","f